# API Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7297


### 1. GET - Get All Patients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Accept: application/json


### 2. GET - Get Patient By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/2
Accept: application/json


### 3. POST - Register New Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "Su Su Win",
    "age": 25,
    "gender": "Female",
    "phone": "09123456789",
    "address": "Hinthada, Myanmar"
}


### 4. PUT - Update Patient
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "Su Su Win Updated",
    "age": 26,
    "gender": "Female",
    "phone": "09123456789",
    "address": "Yangon, Myanmar"
}


### 5. GET - Get All Doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors
Accept: application/json


### Generate Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "patientID": 2,
    "doctorID": 1
}